{
  "version": "0.5.1",
  "notes": "Add BLE command 'log'/'log_now' to post one Power_Log row over cellular on demand -- for testing/using Sheets logging once mounted on the boat with no laptop attached (BLE from the phone is the only way to trigger anything there). Forces prefer_wifi=False since BLE is active during this command; Wi-Fi and BLE share one radio and would drop the connection you used to trigger it. Also fixes the existing 'ota' BLE command, which was about to inherit that same Wi-Fi-vs-BLE conflict now that ota.py prefers Wi-Fi by default -- it now also forces prefer_wifi=False. See APPS_SCRIPT_SETUP.md for the three distinct testing/operation modes (bench test, BLE Log Now, and not-yet-built automatic periodic logging).",
